# Vibe Engineer — local OpenRouter configuration (milestone 3A)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` at the REPOSITORY ROOT (not here) and fill in the
# values. `.env` is gitignored (see .gitignore: `.env`) — never commit it.
#
# drawing_qa.py seeds ONLY these OPENROUTER_* variables from `.env` at the
# repo root; real environment variables always win. Values are never printed
# or logged.
#
# Required for `python tools/ocs/drawing_qa.py ask` (the model call).
# Get the key at https://openrouter.ai/keys — keep it out of git and out of
# the command line.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional. OpenRouter model id used when --model is not given.
# (default: z-ai/glm-5.3-flash — a PLAN.md candidate; configurable, never a price)
#OPENROUTER_MODEL=z-ai/glm-5.3-flash

# Optional. Tracked-spend cap in USD for drawing_qa.py model calls.
# (default: 5.00 — the PLAN.md initial evaluation budget)
#OPENROUTER_SPEND_CAP_USD=5.00
